    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93379" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαρκ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,=
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαρκοειδής</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fleshy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				22
			</span></i>, <i>Aër.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				4.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.30
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοὶ ἔναιμοι καὶ
			σαρκώδεες</span> gods <i>of flesh</i> and blood, <i><span class="en">
