					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					1.10.4
				</span></i>
			, al.; of timber, ib.<i><span class="en">
				5.1.5
			</span></i>; of wine, <i>of a full body</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				1.27c
			</span></i>.</div>
